PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F449A1789748867
OL,1,W5j 5Q5wsj  ws jkjs j#7kjs57k
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASmart glasses bring 'considerable
OL,4,Aprivacy risks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials said smart glasses were
OL,7,F"increasingly" being used, including in
OL,8,Fworkplaces and businesses. Paul Vane,
OL,9,FJersey Information Commissioner, said
OL,10,Fthere were "benefits" to the
OL,11,Ftechnology, but warned "there are also
OL,12,Fconsiderable privacy risks".
OL,14,FThe authorities have urged users to be
OL,15,F"mindful and respectful" and consider
OL,16,Fwhen recording is appropriate.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
